  "title": "UK Blood Pressure Medicine Shortage: What Patients Taking Ramipril and Propranolol Should Know",
  "summary": "A new warning about medicine supplies has raised concerns for people across the UK who rely on common blood pressure treatments. Ramipril and propranolol have been highlighted among medicines experiencing supply pressures, with some strengths reportedly more affected than others. The situation does not mean that every patient taking these medicines will be unable to obtain their prescription. However, patients who depend on regular medication should be aware of the issue and speak with a pharma",
